    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/4731b890161735afab61c8cddf2da9df.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=800 height=65 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/4731b890161735afab61c8cddf2da9df.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Tagged</u></i></strong> is a true first person survival horror game where you traverse through a mountain village as a graffiti artist. Leave your \u201ctag\u201d on wood shacks, rock walls, or other structures and pray the locals admire it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In graffiti culture,</strong> a \u201ctag\u201d or \u201ctagging\u201d is referred to as an artist\u2019s artistic signature or original piece. Mostly relying on legibility and flow within the art. You will attempt to spray tags throughout the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/ecead64971d8c8f4920136c773cdc77c.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/ecead64971d8c8f4920136c773cdc77c.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/ecead64971d8c8f4920136c773cdc77c.mp4?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/bdc42277105a58adf2fb76554c12611d.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=800 height=65 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/bdc42277105a58adf2fb76554c12611d.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tagged features a <strong>rural mountain village</strong>, comprised of an eerily calming atmosphere. This is the perfect breeding ground for your artistic emotions. The darkness, the glossy flow of red blood cells, the matte finish on pored skin. There\u2019s simply too much inspiration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/5357bd9d2a7f5cdd85946d9767e17dbe.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/5357bd9d2a7f5cdd85946d9767e17dbe.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/5357bd9d2a7f5cdd85946d9767e17dbe.mp4?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/42cbbf41ca56726d97b7aeca26d8d567.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=800 height=65 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/42cbbf41ca56726d97b7aeca26d8d567.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Staying in one place</strong> is <i><u>not</u></i> common practice for artists; both physically and mentally. Hiding is also very strange. Most right brained people move around, so staying in one place actually makes you stand out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/65aaa303ac662925fc33a608a2bb784c.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/65aaa303ac662925fc33a608a2bb784c.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/65aaa303ac662925fc33a608a2bb784c.mp4?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/c9f0066d6d48c869ded505e7b8a0c28a.poster.avif?t=1730746181\" width=800 height=65 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177330/extras/c9f0066d6d48c869ded505e7b8a0c28a.webm?t=1730746181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True First Person Experience</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Mappable Input Keys</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MiniGame On Completion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Graphic Settings</p></li></ul>",
